{"4449380":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"デスハネムーン Deadly Honeymoon","steam_appid":4449380,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are taking your newlywed wife on a honeymoon to spend 4 nights at an oceanfront resort hotel. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your luxurious room comes with a hot tub.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If there are no anomalies, the player should go to bed; whereas if there is an anomaly, the player should call the reception in order to progress to the next day.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“デスハネムーン Deadly Honeymoon” is a short, first-person game with a bit of horror that should take around 60 to 90 minutes to complete.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game controls are simple. To play, navigate the room by walking (mouse movement with WASD keys,) selecting options (left click,) and zooming in (right click.)<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s a walking simulator game inspired by The Exit 8 where players navigate a closed room, searching for anomalies to continue to the end of the honeymoon.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no restriction on streaming the gameplay and\/or uploading play-through videos, however, the creators assume all risks.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are taking your newlywed wife on a honeymoon to spend 4 nights at an oceanfront resort hotel. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your luxurious room comes with a hot tub.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If there are no anomalies, the player should go to bed; whereas if there is an anomaly, the player should call the reception in order to progress to the next day.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“デスハネムーン Deadly Honeymoon” is a short, first-person game with a bit of horror that should take around 60 to 90 minutes to complete.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game controls are simple. To play, navigate the room by walking (mouse movement with WASD keys,) selecting options (left click,) and zooming in (right click.)<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s a walking simulator game inspired by The Exit 8 where players navigate a closed room, searching for anomalies to continue to the end of the honeymoon.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no restriction on streaming the gameplay and\/or uploading play-through videos, however, the creators assume all risks.<\/p>","short_description":"You are on your honeymoon, spending 4 nights at an oceanfront resort hotel. If you see something out of place in your room, call the reception. If everything seems normal, go to bed.","supported_languages":"영어, 일본어","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4449380\/ba907e2c3c49c4181de84a0b9bd07e3fed03542f\/header.jpg?t=1773391648","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4449380\/c343e972d2f9e42255e92e82116e2324659c3f06\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773391648","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4449380\/c343e972d2f9e42255e92e82116e2324659c3f06\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773391648","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>최소:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>운영 체제:<\/strong> Windows 10 64bit<br><\/li><li><strong>프로세서:<\/strong> intel Core i7 4770<br><\/li><li><strong>메모리:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>그래픽:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 970<br><\/li><li><strong>저장 공간:<\/strong> 1 GB 사용 가능 공간<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["Gonta"],"publishers":["Gonta"],"price_overview":{"currency":"KRW","initial":340000,"final":340000,"discount_percent":0,"initial_formatted":"","final_formatted":"₩ 3,400"},"packages":[1553348],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"デスハネムーン Deadly Honeymoon 구매","description":"","selection_text":"구매 옵션을